    title: "Website development cost in Dubai: what UAE businesses pay",
    excerpt: "What a business website really costs in Dubai in 2026 — AED price ranges, what drives them, Arabic/RTL and VAT practicalities, and how to compare quotes.",
    date: "2026-11-20",
