      "Whether the project is in Dubai or anywhere else, send us the outline — or just tell us about your project in a paragraph. We will reply within one business day with an honest view of the right tier and what it should cost. You can also write to us directly at hello@cinem.tech, or explore our website development service first. Our global guide, how much does a website cost, covers the same ground without the UAE specifics.",
